      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后，两个人握着暖宝宝，\n一边漫无目的地闲聊着，\n一边等待日出――",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a758933a34d59395817befd77d526009d32ba27aad6456ac380951f916db2ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
